{
  "name": "Favored Enemy",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have significant experience studying, tracking, hunting, and even talking to a certain type of enemy commonly encountered in the wilds.</p><p>Choose a creature type. You gain a +2 bonus to damage rolls with weapon attacks or ranger spells that use a weapon or piece of ammunition as a material component against the chosen type.</p><p>Additionally, you have Advantage on Wisdom and Intelligence checks that pertain to your favored enemies.</p>",
